OL,4,CCatherine talks openly about how       
OL,5,Ccancer changed her in documentary on   
OL,6,CBBC                                    
OL,7,GThe Princess of Wales has spoken about 
OL,8,Ghow "cancer does change you," in a     
OL,9,Gforthcoming documentary called Heal to 
OL,10,Gbe shown on the BBC.                   
OL,12,F"It changes your body, it changes you  
OL,13,Fphysically - but there is a much, much 
OL,14,Fdeeper part to what a cancer diagnosis 
OL,15,Fshifts in you," says Catherine in the  
OL,16,Ffirst glimpses from the documentary,   
OL,17,Fwhich features her private thoughts on 
OL,18,Fher illness and recovery.              
